{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion","title":"lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":3593,"body":"","kind":"lemma","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-tensor-along-map]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion","line":6169,"source":"\\begin{lemma}[A Pseudo-Riemannian Submanifold is Immersed]\n\\label{lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion}\n\n\\uses{def:induced-tensor-along-map}\n\n\n\n\nIf the pseudo-Riemannian metric $g$ is induced along smooth $F$, then every $dF_p$ is injective.\n\\end{lemma}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{def:induced-tensor-along-map}\n\\sketch If $dF_pv=0$, then Definition \\ref{def:induced-tensor-along-map} gives $g_p(v,w)=0$ for every $w$; nondegeneracy forces $v=0$.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Lemma</div></section>[A Pseudo-Riemannian Submanifold is Immersed] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6c656d3a70736575646f2d7375626d616e69666f6c642d696d6d657273696f6e\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainduced-tensor-along-map\">↗ def:induced-tensor-along-map</a> <p></p>If the pseudo-Riemannian metric <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$g$\">$g$</span> is induced along smooth <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$F$\">$F$</span>, then every <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$dF_p$\">$dF_p$</span> is injective.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainduced-tensor-along-map\">↗ def:induced-tensor-along-map</a> \\sketch If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$dF_pv=0$\">$dF_pv=0$</span>, then Definition <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainduced-tensor-along-map\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-tensor-along-map\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6465663a696e64756365642d74656e736f722d616c6f6e672d6d6170\">17</a> gives <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$g_p(v,w)=0$\">$g_p(v,w)=0$</span> for every <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$w$\">$w$</span>; nondegeneracy forces <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$v=0$\">$v=0$</span>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-tensor-along-map","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-submanifold-induced-tensor","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-tensor-along-map","title":"def:induced-tensor-along-map","label":"def:induced-tensor-along-map"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:differential-isometry-tangent-range","title":"lem:differential-isometry-tangent-range","label":"lem:differential-isometry-tangent-range"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point","title":"prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point","label":"prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-signature","title":"prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-signature","label":"prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-signature"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:pseudo-riemannian-adapted-frame","title":"prop:pseudo-riemannian-adapted-frame","label":"prop:pseudo-riemannian-adapted-frame"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion","title":"lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion","tex":"\\begin{lemma}[A Pseudo-Riemannian Submanifold is Immersed]\n\\label{lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion}\n\n\\uses{def:induced-tensor-along-map}\n\n\n\n\nIf the pseudo-Riemannian metric $g$ is induced along smooth $F$, then every $dF_p$ is injective.\n\\end{lemma}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{def:induced-tensor-along-map}\n\\sketch If $dF_pv=0$, then Definition \\ref{def:induced-tensor-along-map} gives $g_p(v,w)=0$ for every $w$; nondegeneracy forces $v=0$.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-tensor-along-map","title":"def:induced-tensor-along-map","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}